	(text "OUTPUTS: AOUTA/B -> 470R / 1n C0G -> U5A/B gain 3.2 (Rg 10k to VREF_OUT, Rf 22k)\n-> 50k volume (0..1) -> U7A/B follower -> 2k || 2k (1k / 0.5W) -> jack. 3.25 Vpp DAC full scale -> +/-5.2 V.\nPower-up: AOUT starts at 0 V (Popguard) so the outputs sit near -8 V for ~0.4 s."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "49ce06b5-af0d-5d40-b061-ab88b02a0cb4")
	)
	(text "INPUTS: jack (TN = GND) -> 50k volume (0..1) -> 1k -> U4A/B follower (+/-12 V, at the pots)\n-> U6A/B inverting driver on +5VA (-0.255, + at VB_IN) -> 220R / 2.2n C0G -> AINA/AINB.\n+/-5.49 V = 2.8 Vpp ADC full scale. ADC_INV restores the polarity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9751377b-3492-5258-86d1-7954d17ee2cd")
	)
	(text "CS4270 CODEC: I2C control port, address 0x48. Master, quad speed: MCLK 24.576 MHz / 128 = 192 kHz;\nSCLK = 64 x Fs to both CH32V307 I2S slaves (I2S2 RX, I2S3 TX). HPF freeze (reg 04h b7/b6) for DC.\nFirmware: RST high after clocks, write PDN within 1045 LRCK periods, then FM = quad master."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "995c8e3c-4339-51e5-aae2-e321c98470bd")
	)
	(text "MCU BOARD LINK: J6/J7 1x10 2.54 mm male headers (plastic on the carrier F side);\nthe MCU board (usb-audio-mcu) solders on top. BOOT/RESET and SWD on the carrier (B side):\nhold BOOT, press RESET = CH32V307 ROM bootloader on the USB-C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 449.58 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b276629e-4447-5d16-8be4-15f107e50c39")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR USB-AUDIO - carrier (jack/pot board), S3. 2 in / 2 out, DC-coupled +/-5 V, CS4270 24-bit 192 kHz. Circuit intent: docs/research.md; placement: docs/geometry.json"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "be987935-3027-536f-9bde-64ea4e968ea1")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: GND/+12V/-12V at J1; +12V_F/-12V_F behind D2/D1; V3_IN behind R1; +3V3_C behind FB1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ce38b730-ff94-5a0f-8fb7-16cc7f30fabd")
	)
	(text "REFERENCES (+5VA): U6C buffers VQ (VA/2) -> VB_IN = VQ x 20/25.1 (input drivers);\nU6D: VREF_OUT = VQ x 32/22 (output stages). Both track the codec mid-rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 309.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dfbc35fc-a5a4-5039-afe0-0c7b19edb274")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> D2 -> +12V_F (op-amps; U1 AMS1117-5.0 -> +5VA; R1 33R -> U2 AMS1117-3.3 -> +3V3 -> FB1 -> +3V3_C); -12V -> D1 -> -12V_F"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ea4a9bfa-b900-51f1-a87c-c756833c5c8d")
	)
